within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.J_AntiinfectivesForSystemicUse.J01A_Tetracyclines.J01AA12_Tigecycline;
model Tigecycline_Deshpande2025_PD_bacterial_burden
  "sigmoid_emax exposure-response sweep — Deshpande_2025 :: bacterial burden (bacterial burden)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep(
    E0 = 10.83,      // [log10 CFU/mL]
    Emax = -10,  // [log10 CFU/mL]
    EC50 = 0.00531,  // [kg/m3; mg/L × 0.001]
    gamma = 1.38,
    exposure_per_s = 0.001);   // 1 mg/L per second
  // imax_as_negative_emax: Imax (Q323) enters SigmoidEmaxSweep as −Emax
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 54, Interval = 0.108),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Tigecycline_Deshpande2025_PD_bacterial_burden</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Deshpande D et al., <i>bioRxiv : the preprint server for biology</i> 2025 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.07.29.667481\">doi:10.1101/2025.07.29.667481</a>) — bacterial burden against tigecycline mg/L — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: sigmoid_emax.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =      10.83 log10 CFU/mL drug-free response (baseline) (Econ, Q324)
  Emax  =         10 log10 CFU/mL maximal effect term (Emax, Q323)
  EC50  =       5.31 mg/L     exposure at half of the maximal effect term (EC50, Q321)
  gamma =       1.38          Hill coefficient (H, Q325)</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep\">SigmoidEmaxSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one mg/L of tigecycline per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 10.83   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (5.31 mg/L)  response 5.83
  exposure -> infinity  response 0.83</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Deshpande_2025: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Tigecycline_Deshpande2025_PD_bacterial_burden;
